| Issue | Why it Happens | Fix |
|-------|----------------|-----|
| **CORS errors** (`tainted canvas`) | The image is hosted on a different origin without `Access-Control-Allow-Origin:*` | Serve the icons with proper CORS headers **or** proxy them through your own domain. Set `img.crossOrigin = 'anonymous'` when you create an `HTMLImageElement`. |
